 #. option rtx.atmosphere.aerosolAbsorption
-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:305
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:312
 msgid "Scale on mieAbsorption [0..4], with aerosolDensity: how much of the light the aerosol meets it absorbs rather than scatters. 1 = as mieAbsorption sets it; low values make a bright, milky haze (water and sulfate haze scatter nine tenths of it), high ones a dark, smoky one. The weathers set it."
 msgstr "作用于 mieAbsorption 的倍率 [0..4]，与 aerosolDensity 共同决定气溶胶遇到的光有多少被吸收而非散射。1 = mieAbsorption 设定的吸收量；较低值会形成明亮、乳白色的雾霭（水滴和硫酸盐形成的雾霭会散射其中十分之九的光），较高值会形成暗淡、烟雾状的雾霭。各类天气会设置此值。"
 
