-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:430
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:435
 msgid "Forward-glow emphasis ONLY: scales the directional silver-lining term (Lambert diffuse + HG phase) in front of the moon and nothing else. The overall cloud-moon level (incl. airglow) is Cloud Brightness (Global Lighting) - set that first, then emphasize here. 0 = no silver lining. Diffuse-vs-phase ratio: .conf moonCloudDiffuseGain / moonCloudPhaseGain."
 msgstr "“仅”用于强调前向辉光：只缩放月亮前方的定向银边项（Lambert 漫反射 + HG 相位），不影响其他任何内容。云层月光的整体亮度（包括气辉）由“云层亮度”（位于“整体光照”中）控制——请先设置它，再在此处进行强调。0 = 无银边。漫反射与相位的比例：.conf 中的 moonCloudDiffuseGain / moonCloudPhaseGain。"
 
-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:437
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:442
 msgid "Silver Lining Sharpness"
 msgstr "银边锐度"
 
